        prompts: {
          human: 'Welcome to Forty-Five, the Irish classic. Five tricks per hand. The trump suit is shown. In trumps: 5 is highest, Jack is second, and remember the Ace of Hearts is always a trump regardless of suit. Highest trump wins the trick. First team to 45 points wins the game.',
          ai: 'Game: Forty-Five (Irish trick-taking). Deal: 5 cards to each player; one card turned for trump. Trick rules: 5 tricks per hand. Trump ranking (high to low): 5 of Trump, Jack of Trump, Ace of Hearts (always trump), Ace of Trump (if not Hearts), K, Q, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 4, 3, 2. Red suits (Hearts/Diamonds): K-Q-10-9-8-7-6-5-4-3-2. Black suits (Spades/Clubs): K-Q-2-3-4-5-6-7-8-9-10. Scoring: 5 points per trick won; first team to 45 points wins. Spoil rule: If no team wins 3 tricks, the hand is spoiled and no points awarded.',
        },
